  "class": "PRE-REGISTRATION. Committed before any pod of this attempt exists; git history is the only witness that it preceded the money. It FREEZES at the FIRST `pod create` of the attempt and nothing after that may edit it — a recreated pod reads the SAME frozen record, which is what makes a replacement a segment of one attempt, not a second one",
